                "text": "The \u2018Big, Ugly Law\u2019 will kick 17 million people off their healthcare, including nearly 2 million Floridians.\n\nHospitals will close. People will die.\n\nMy Democratic colleagues and I are committed to always fighting for Medicaid, the Affordable Care Act, and healthcare for all. https://t.co/xxcrcCNdkU",
