                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Federal healthcare tax credits that millions of Floridians rely on expire this year.\n\nCongress let them lapse in the 'Big, Ugly Law' to give billionaires tax breaks.\n\nWithout action, millions will lose coverage. We must renew these tax credits ASAP, and I stand ready to do so.",
