                "text": "Miami-Dade has the most to lose if Congress fails to extend the expiring health care tax credits. South Florida has 4 of the TOP 5 DISTRICTS NATIONWIDE in Affordable Care Act enrollment.\n\nIf Congress doesn\u2019t act, people lose coverage. We must renew these tax credits NOW! https://t.co/CukYYSBlzJ",
