                "text": "My South Florida district has so much to lose if Congress doesn\u2019t renew the expiring health care tax credits.\n\nHere at home, 286,525 people will face higher costs, and nearly 100,000 could lose their coverage entirely.\n\nWE MUST RENEW THESE HEALTH CARE TAX CREDITS NOW! https://t.co/t4OqHA94Ej",
