                "retweet_count": 7,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "THE HEALTH CARE CRISIS IS HERE!\n\nWith Congress failing to renew the health care tax credits, premiums will skyrocket, and people will lose coverage. \n\nNotices are going out now, and every day of delay means more people go uninsured. Congress must act now! https://t.co/eYXNXygunt",
