                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "WHY ARE PEOPLE TALKING ABOUT HEALTHCARE  NOW?\n\nHealthcare tax credits that help millions afford care are expiring this year. They lower premiums, and without Congress renewing it, people will get notices of shockingly higher costs this month, leaving many unable to afford care.",
