                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "WHY IS SOUTH FLORIDA LEADING THE NATION?\n\nFlorida Republican Legislatures never accepted federal government funding to expand Medicaid, leaving millions uninsured.\n\nThe Affordable Care Act tax credits offered Floridians a safety net and the coverage they deserved.",
