                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "WHAT WILL HAPPEN TO FLORIDIANS NOW?\n\nIF THE HEALTHCARE TAX CREDITS EXPIRE, PREMIUMS WILL DOUBLE AND IN SOME CASES TRIPLE. HEALTHCARE WILL BE UNAFFORDABLE AND FLORIDIANS WILL DIE!",
